    "postalCode": {
      "label": "XXXXX-XXXXX or 8-character grid",
      "required": false,
      "usage": "Use the May 2026 Correos Panama national geolocated code as the full two-character estafeta prefix plus eight-character grid, canonically XXXXX-XXXXX. The official decoder also accepts the eight-character grid without an estafeta prefix; do not invent the prefix offline. A live result can return postal zone, estafeta, province, district, corregimiento, settlement and barrio context plus a PICO cell, but public API visibility is not a bulk redistribution licence. The 2015 UPU sheet predates the new system. INEC territorial codes and IGN 1:25,000 DPA geometry remain administrative context, not postal-zone or grid-cell assignment. Building display requires a rights-cleared civic address ID, a building ID and an explicit reviewed relation; point, cell, postcode, area, parcel, containment and proximity are insufficient. AGID remains an independent spatial index."
    },
